For every integer \(n\ge 8\), let \(\rho_{n,2}:=\rho_n((1,-1))\) denote the unrestricted labeled-schedule minimax risk for the two-arm contrast \((1,-1)\). Then
\[
\frac{(1-n^{-1/3})^2}
{n/(1-n^{-2/3}/4)+40n^{2/3}}
\le \rho_{n,2}
\]
and
\[
n^{-1}-43n^{-4/3}\le \rho_{n,2}.
\]
